<navigation-bar title="暑假一起过" background="#f3efe5" color="#263f38"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="daily-page" scroll-y scroll-with-animation scroll-into-view="{{scrollTarget}}">
  <view wx:if="{{!isLoggedIn}}" class="guest-module page-shell"><view class="eyebrow">DAILY MOMENTS</view><view class="page-title">给每一天，<br/>留一点生活的证据。</view><view class="page-subtitle">登录后可以按日期、时间和心情记录生活片段，把日程、故事和感受都收进自己的手账。</view><view class="guest-icon">✿</view><button bindtap="goLogin">登录后开始记录</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="daily-hero"><view class="hero-orbit"></view><view class="hero-kicker">DAILY MOMENTS / 2026</view><view class="hero-title">我的每日<br/>生活手账</view><view class="hero-note">一顿饭、一次见面、一点心情，都是今天独有的章节。</view><view class="hero-flower">✿</view></view>
    <view class="page-shell daily-body">
      <view class="daily-summary"><view><text>{{todayCount}}</text><view>今天记录</view></view><view><text>{{importantCount}}</text><view>重要时刻</view></view><view><text>{{diaries.length}}</text><view>全部片段</view></view></view>
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">记下一个生活片段</view><view class="section-link">{{editingId ? '正在编辑' : '随时补记'}}</view></view>
      <view id="diary-form" class="diary-form surface"><form bindsubmit="saveDiary"><view class="form-heading"><view><text>{{editingId ? '修改这条记录' : '今天发生了什么？'}}</text><view>用日期、时间、分类和心情，把生活慢慢写完整</view></view><view wx:if="{{editingId}}" class="cancel-edit" bindtap="cancelEdit">取消编辑</view></view><view class="field-label">日期、时间与心情</view><view class="schedule-row"><picker mode="date" value="{{diaryDate}}" bindchange="changeDiaryDate"><view class="date-field">{{diaryDate}}⌄</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{diaryTime}}" bindchange="changeDiaryTime"><view class="date-field">{{diaryTime}}⌄</view></picker></view><picker class="mood-picker" range="{{moods}}" value="{{moodIndex}}" bindchange="changeMood"><view class="date-field">{{moods[moodIndex]}}⌄</view></picker><view class="field-label">分类</view><input class="diary-field" value="{{diaryCategory}}" bindinput="inputDiaryCategory" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：朋友、运动、家人、出行、独处" /><view class="field-label">标题 <text>必填</text></view><input class="diary-field title-field" value="{{diaryTitle}}" bindinput="inputDiaryTitle" maxlength="40" placeholder="给这个片段起个标题" /><view class="field-label">发生的事与感受 <text>必填</text></view><textarea class="diary-field diary-content-input" value="{{diaryContent}}" bindinput="inputDiaryContent" maxlength="500" placeholder="记录发生了什么、和谁一起、当时有什么感受……"></textarea><view class="important-row"><view><view>标记为重要</view><text>重要片段会在时间轴上留下星标</text></view><switch color="#913b33" checked="{{diaryImportant}}" bindchange="changeImportant" /></view><button class="save-button" form-type="submit">{{editingId ? '保存修改' : '保存这条记录'}}</button></form></view>
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">我的生活日历</view><view class="section-link">{{diaries.length}} 条记录</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!diaryGroups.length}}" class="journal-empty surface"><view>☀</view><text>今天还没有生活记录</text><view>散步、发呆、见朋友，都可以写在这里。</view></view>
      <view class="day-group" wx:for="{{diaryGroups}}" wx:key="date" wx:for-item="group"><view class="day-heading"><view>{{group.label}}</view><text>{{group.items.length}} 个片段</text></view><view class="day-timeline"><view class="diary-record" wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="diary"><view class="time-column"><text>{{diary.time || '—'}}</text><view></view></view><view class="record-card surface {{diary.important ? 'important' : ''}}"><view class="record-top"><view class="category-tag">{{diary.category}}</view><view class="mood-tag">{{diary.mood}}</view></view><view class="record-title">{{diary.important ? '★ ' : ''}}{{diary.title}}</view><view class="record-content">{{diary.content}}</view><view class="record-footer"><text>{{diary.timeLabel}}</text><view><text bindtap="editDiary" data-id="{{diary.id}}">编辑</text><text bindtap="deleteDiary" data-id="{{diary.id}}">删除</text></view></view></view></view></view></view>
      <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">每日一歌</view><view class="section-link">{{todayLabel}}</view></view>
      <view class="song-card surface"><view class="record"><view class="record-center">♪</view></view><view class="song-copy"><view class="song-label">TODAY'S SONG</view><view class="song-title">{{currentSong.title}}</view><view class="song-artist">{{currentSong.artist}}</view><view class="song-note">{{currentSong.note}}</view><view class="song-actions"><button class="change-song" bindtap="nextSong">换一首 ↻</button><button class="favorite-song {{isCurrentFavorite ? 'saved' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleFavorite">{{isCurrentFavorite ? '已收藏 ♥' : '收藏 ♡'}}</button></view></view></view>
      <view class="last-line">认真生活，<br/>也认真保存生活。</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</scroll-view>
